message: "If you use this formalisation in your research, please cite it as follows."
title: "M4TH: Formalised PDE and Analytic Number Theory in Lean 4"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21635317
version: 3.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-28
authors:
  - family-names: Izquierdo Perez
    given-names: Bezalel
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-5993-4057"
    alias: Alektronnik
repository-code: "https://github.com/Alektronnik/M4TH"
url: "https://github.com/Alektronnik/M4TH"
abstract: >
  Self-contained formalisation in Lean 4 over Mathlib of elementary PDE theory
  and analytic number theory. Eight independent packages across three releases:
  v1.0.0 -- PDE (ConservationLaws, BurgersBlowUp, KdV).
  v2.0.0 -- Riemann-von Mangoldt (DirichletEta, ZetaZeroCounting, XiLogResidue,
  XiLogDeriv).
  v3.0.0 -- Meissel-Mertens constant, compensated prime harmonic convergence,
  conditional PNT+ closure (MertensPNT, 281 theorems).
  Zero axioms, zero sorry.
  Every headline theorem carries the clean axiom certificate [propext,
  Classical.choice, Quot.sound].
